  "notes": [
    "**Saber** is completely irregular",
    "Present: irregular \"yo\" form with accent (sé), otherwise regular -ER endings",
    "Preterite: completely irregular stem \"sup-\"",
    "Imperfect: regular -ER pattern based on infinitive stem \"sab-\"",
    "Pretérito Perfecto: regular past participle **sabido**",
    "Future: irregular stem \"sabr-\" (not \"saber-\")",
    "Condicional: irregular stem \"sabr-\" + conditional endings",
    "Used for facts/information (*sé la respuesta*) and skills (*sé nadar* - I know how to swim)",
    "Don't confuse with **conocer** (to know people/places)",
    "Common usage: *No lo sé* (I don't know), *Supe la verdad* (I found out the truth)",
    "In preterite, often means \"to find out\": *Supe ayer* (I found out yesterday)"
  ],
